			"updated": 1792852937150,
			"created": 1792849092722,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Consider a supplier, part, and project relationship. Suppose\nthe business rules guarantee that a supplier can supply a\npart to a project whenever all three of the following\npairwise relationships exist:\n\n- The supplier supplies the part.\n- The supplier is approved for the project.\n- The project uses the part.",
			"rawText": "Consider a supplier, part, and project relationship. Suppose the business rules guarantee that a supplier can supply a part to a project whenever all three of the following pairwise relationships exist:\n\n- The supplier supplies the part.\n- The supplier is approved for the project.\n- The project uses the part.",
			"fontSize": 28,
			"baseFontSize": null,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Consider a supplier, part, and project relationship. Suppose the business rules guarantee that a supplier can supply a part to a project whenever all three of the following pairwise relationships exist:\n\n- The supplier supplies the part.\n- The supplier is approved for the project.\n- The project uses the part.",
			"autoResize": false,
